# Execution gates

- SKIP tecnico: `training` / `data` / `deploy` / `predict_error` / stop-win `EXEC_PAUSE` / `regime_squeeze` / `neg_edge_zscore_panic` / `live_exec_discord` (so se flag on)
- Soft sinal (escopo **1.1**): SSOT `signal_skip` — mini/cal/chop soft Kelly; **neg_edge** le o Edge da direção final (ancorado em `fusion_p_call`/`fusion_p_put` indexados pelo **EXEC final** se fusão aplicada, senao Cal TCN; `fusion_p_eff` sync apos flip); contrato `gate_verdict` **HARD_SKIP | SOFT_SIZE | ALLOW**; com `neg_edge_hard_skip` **true** (SSOT) Edge `<= 0` → HARD (`gate_reason=neg_edge`); Edge `< min_edge_*` (explore = recovery **0.015**, inclusive subfloor positivo) → HARD (`neg_edge_subfloor_hard`); Soft_SIZE so soft flags **com** Edge >= floor (**proibido** Single-Strike); **nao** Soft_SIZE para `0 < Edge < floor`; Edge >= floor + sem soft → ALLOW; seed `boot_deep` se Cal < `neg_edge_deep_edge_floor` **−0.12** no hard; trava de pânico Z-score bilateral: CALL vetado se $Z < -2.0$, PUT vetado se $Z > +2.0$ (`gate_reason=neg_edge_zscore_panic`; telemetria `Z=`/`side`/`thr`)
- Soft flags (`fusion_weak_ev_soft` / `loss_clf_soft` / cal/mini/chop) e `gate_verdict=SOFT_SIZE` bloqueiam `apply_stop_win_kelly_boost` (Single-Strike so em ALLOW)
- **Regime boolean** (`regime_gate_enabled` **true**): ADX < `regime_adx_max` + BB squeeze → HARD `gate_reason=regime_squeeze` **sem** alterar CALL/PUT; telemetria `REGIME || HARD_SKIP`
- **Micro protect** (`micro_discord_hard_skip` / `chop_loss_risk_hard_skip` **true**): vela M5 ≠ EXEC com confirmacao tape/ops → HARD `micro_discord`; chop + `p_loss`>=**0.85** (soft/FLIP_BLOCK) → HARD `chop_loss_risk`; **sem** flip de lado
- **Anti-loss direcional off** no SSOT (`anti_loss_allow_candle_flip` **false**, `anti_loss_live_*` **false**, `anti_loss_seed_discord_enabled` **false`): paths de flip/EMA/RSI soft permanecem no codigo para testes; **nao** sao filtro vivo. Confirmacao operacional = TCN+fusao+regime+micro_protect+neg_edge.
- **Fusao EV** (`execution_direction_fusion*`): argmax CALL/PUT; `fusion_block_when_tcn_pos_edge` **true**; `fusion_block_when_tcn_candle_agree` **false**; soft EV fraco **0.50** / seed dual-EV<0 **0.25**; telemetria `[GATES] || FUSION` usa `fusion_side`
- Loss ML: container `aether-loss-classifier` → soft graduado; FLIP so com `p_loss>=0.90` + `veto_ready` + `flip_require_auto_learn` **true** (seed = SOFT); `FLIP_BLOCK:seed_candle|tcn_edge|seed|scale`; `flip_waive_tcn_pos_edge_on_discord` **true** libera `tcn_edge` se tape ou **janela ops** ≠ TCN
- `min_direction_margin` padrao **0.005**; nao restaurar quality gate amplo legado
- SCALE adapta lado + soft Kelly; **sem** SKIP por escala; `invert_exec_side` **false**
- Cooldown técnico: 1 ciclo ($300\,\text{s}$) após $L_2+$ (`consecutive_losses_linear >= 2`); transição suave ($0\,\text{s}$) em $L_1$.
- EXEC_EMPTY tecnico = sucesso de processo quando coerente; catalogo: `docs/binary-senior-playbook.md` + `docs/engineering-settings-ssot.md` + `docs/infra-docker.md`

- Regime boolean (`regime_gate_enabled` **true**): ADX < `regime_adx_max` + BB squeeze -> HARD `gate_reason=regime_squeeze` sem alterar CALL/PUT; anti-loss direcional off (`anti_loss_allow_candle_flip` **false**, seed discord **false**).
